# Public build-time config only (rule R5): everything here ends up in the browser bundle.
# Origin of org-admin-api: scheme + host + optional port, no path (no /api/v1), no trailing credentials.
# Production: https://api.mmlabs.online. Required: sign-in always goes to this API (screens still use mock data until their tickets).
# Local real API through the Vite dev proxy: http://localhost:5173 (see README).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# App key sent as X-MM-App and used as token audience (required, `admin`).
VITE_APP_KEY=
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public) for the sign-in challenge.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# Release images (docker build / release.yml) bake VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.mmlabs.online and
# VITE_APP_KEY=admin, with the site key from the repository variable VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY.
# See docs/deploy.md.
